# Real mode envs — populate to drive `ably` against a live Ably project.
# When ABLY_API_KEY is missing the dogfood adapter emits `ABLY_ENV_MISSING`
# traces and the fidelity harness records the gap. When the env is set but
# the `ably` package is not vendored (the default in this workspace), the
# adapter downgrades to `ABLY_SDK_MISSING` — one level closer to real IO.
ABLY_API_KEY=your-ably-api-key
ABLY_CLIENT_ID=optional-client-id
